OL,3,AFBI reportedly investigating apparent
OL,4,Ahack of its criminal database
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen asked about the breach in a Fox
OL,7,FNews interview on Saturday, President
OL,8,FDonald Trump said he had "just heard"
OL,9,Fabout the hack. "I will say that it's
OL,10,Fnot good. I don't like that," he said.
